        Your competitors don't
        <span>announce when they change.</span>
    </h2>

    <p>
        A competitor can change a price at 2 AM, sell out of a
        product before lunch, or quietly change a product page.
    </p>

    <p>
        You shouldn't need someone checking their websites
        every few hours just to notice.
    </p>

</div>


